# --- Settings ---
media_srcset_settings_title = Settings
media_srcset_settings_intro = Settings for the automatic placeholder replacement in rendered HTML.
media_srcset_settings_output_filter = Replace HTML placeholders srcset="rex_media_type=profile" automatically
media_srcset_settings_output_filter_notice = This approach dates back to earlier versions and scans every page output for placeholders using a regular expression. If you only use the PHP API (rex_media_srcset::getImgTag() or ResponsiveImage), you can switch it off and save that scan on every page request. The change takes effect with the next page request.
